<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Oil and Gas half yr returns to profit.</title>
<headline>NZ Oil and Gas half yr returns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to Dec 31</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   0.70 vs 0.94 loss</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    0.6 vs 0.9 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover			     13.60 vs 13.73</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 0.51 vs 0.43 loss</p>
<p>    Tax					nil vs nil</p>
<p>Note - New Zealand Oil and Gas Ltd is an oil and gas exploration company. The company said the net profit was arrived at after charging depreciation and amortisation of $3.4 million and exploration costs of $2.1 million.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
